WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:02.090
- So I'm watching this whole Matt Gaetz,

00:00:02.090 --> 00:00:03.380
Gaetzgate scandal

00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:05.010
unfold in real time with the same amount

00:00:05.010 --> 00:00:06.680
of astonishment and amusement

00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:07.680
as all of you.

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:10.170
And the facts are coming
out incredibly rapidly.

00:00:10.170 --> 00:00:12.460
Is this a trafficking investigation?

00:00:12.460 --> 00:00:14.718
Is this an extortion investigation?

00:00:14.718 --> 00:00:16.910
We'll find out probably soon.

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:18.280
But I will say this.

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:20.100
There is one thing that
we can all agree on,

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:21.406
and that is that Matt Gaetz

00:00:21.406 --> 00:00:23.500
needs to shut up.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:25.800
He's not doing himself any
favors going on Tucker,

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:28.920
going on a tweet storm on Twitter.

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:32.400
This is not how you put up a
potential criminal defense.

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:34.070
It's not even how you deal with

00:00:34.070 --> 00:00:35.468
a potential extortion ring

00:00:35.468 --> 00:00:38.020
where your father may
have been wearing a wire.

00:00:38.020 --> 00:00:40.919
- They asked my dad to
wear a wire, which he did.

00:00:40.919 --> 00:00:43.270
- Matt Gaetz, do yourself a favor

00:00:43.270 --> 00:00:44.780
and stop talking.

00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:46.350
You've already done enough damage.

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:49.630
- Smearing me and ruining
the investigation.

00:00:49.630 --> 00:00:51.690
- Otherwise, I might see you

00:00:51.690 --> 00:00:52.523
in court.

